---
// First focusable element on every redesigned page; jumps past the top bar.
---

<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

<style>
  .skip-link {
    position: absolute;
    top: 8px;
    left: 8px;
    z-index: 10;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    background-color: var(--ink);
    color: var(--page-bg);
    font-family: var(--body-font);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transform: translateY(-200%);
  }

  .skip-link:focus-visible {
    transform: none;
  }
</style>
